  "releaseNotes": "1.2026.4.3:\n- Search by Principal: cross-entity search by user or team across all shared entity types\n- Discover entity types with record counts, then retrieve shares per entity in tabbed grids\n- Full column parity with entity search (14 columns incl. Created On, State, Access, Inherited Access)\n- Paging, Excel export, details panel, and Shared With button all work per tab\n- GUIDs and Owner-Share Details checkboxes toggle columns across all tabs\n- Smart discovery invalidation with criteria comparison on search parameter changes\n- Grid column widths aligned with entity search layout\n- More at https://ntit.ai/blog/search-shared-data-crm-entities\n- Feedback/comments: https://ameedsheikh.wordpress.com/2017/04/19/search-shared-data-across-crm-entities/",
